[header]
missionType = "Tutorial"
missionNumber = 3
moreGeysers = 1
myStartMoney = 4000
myTech="rainbattery;rainwalker;rainballoon;rainfence;raincannon;rainaviary;rainblocker"
myAllyList = "3"

ai2Name = "Kukulkan"
ai2Tech="windbattery;windwalker;windblocker;windarcher;suncannon;sunballoon;windaviary"
ai2StartMoney = 3000
ai2GeyserAttachments = 6
ai2Collectors = 4
ai2TimeetweenMoves = 2
ai2Allylist = ""

ai3Name = "High Priest"
ai3Tech="rainbattery;raincannon;rainballoon;rainwalker;suncannon;sunarcher;sunballoon;rainblocker"
ai3StartMoney = 2000
ai3GeyserAttachments = 8
ai3Collectors = 10
ai3TimeBetweenMoves = 2
ai3Allylist = "1"

title = "Alliance"

[Options]
[A.]
<h3>Alliance</h3>
<br><i>A good enemy is better than a bad ally<br>
--Book of Nimbus<br></i>
<p>
Your ally is under attack by Kukulkan - the high Priest of Wind. Hurry and save him.
$Button=Rewiev knowledge,Showtechnology,55
$Button=To the rescue,DoNothing,0

[@2]
You get a message from your ally:<br>
~I~l"We are glad that you are here, but we need stormpower to ward off the enemy,
and we're running dangerously low. Please send us some as soon as you can spare it..."~<br>
$Button=Sure I will,DoNothing,0
$Button=Never,Tell,Never

[Never]
<h2>A letter form your ally</h2>
So you refuse to send us stormpower, well if you won't send some then we are going to ally with your enemy
and maybe we'll get some of them! You got 10 minutes to send us some!
$Button=All right I'll send you some,DoNothing,0
$Button=Go ahead who needs you,Tell,Who

[Who]
<h2>Another message</h2>
The nerve, we'll pretend that we didn't hear that...
Remember, you've got <h2>TEN MINUTES</h2>!
$Button=Done,DoNothing,0

[@120]
Another message:<br>
~I~l"How's the stormpower gathering coming along? You know if you'd send us some,
we'll try to help out as we can. Cause we're not used to battle, and we fear that we may be overpowered
very quickly. Please hurry!~<br>
$Button=Ok I'm on it,DoNothing,0

[@300]
Your ally is getting desperate:<br>
~I~l"They're starting to cut us away at our outer defense. We don't know how much longer we can last..~<br>
$Button=Help is on the way,DoNothing,0

[Succeeded][BadTeamDead]
<h3>A message from your ally</h3>
<br>~I~l"Thanks for the help, you are truly a good ally to have!~<br>
<$Config,Done{mission.fileName}=3>
$Button=Next Mission,MissionBegin,Thunderb
$Button=Thank you,MissionAbort,1

[Failed]
<h3>A message from your ally</h3>
<br>~I~d"We knew you would betray us. You're a worthless NOTHING!
Next time, we'll be allies rather with the forces of the Wind!~<br>
$Button=Try Again,Tell,TryAgain

[End]

